.Sh DESCRIPTION
Opens FILE(s) in mdv. With no FILE, reads Markdown from standard input. --html, --fragment, or --output render HTML instead of opening the app.

  mdv README.md
  echo '# Markdown' | mdv
  mdv --html README.md > README.html
  mdv -o README.html README.md
  mdv --fragment intro.md usage.md > body.html
  mdv --html --theme serif --flavor commonmark notes.md
  mdv --html --preprocessor ~/bin/expand --preprocessor-arg -v notes.md

Several FILEs print one after another only with --fragment; --output takes one.

EXIT STATUS:
  0   success
  64  usage error: bad flags, several pages to one output, --output naming
      an input, or no FILE while standard input is a terminal
  65  an input isn't valid UTF-8, or the --theme file isn't a valid theme
  66  an input file is missing or unreadable, or the --theme file is
      missing
  69  the app couldn't be opened
  70  the --preprocessor program couldn't run or failed
  73  the --output file couldn't be written
  74  writing to standard output failed
  Ctrl-C during a --preprocessor run stops the program, then mdv.
.Bl -tag -width 6n
.It Ar FILE...
Markdown files. '-' or no FILE reads standard input.
.It Fl -html
Print a complete HTML page (CSS inline) instead of opening the app.
.It Fl -fragment
Print only the rendered body HTML (no <html>, <head>, or CSS), for embedding. Implies --html.
.It Fl o , -output Ar FILE
Write to FILE instead of standard output, replacing it atomically; never an input file. Implies --html.
.It Fl -theme Ar NAME
The page's theme: github, document, serif, or custom:<file name> from the Themes folder. Beats the document's mdv.theme.
.It Fl -flavor Ar NAME
The Markdown flavor: gfm, commonmark. Beats the document's mdv.flavor.
.It Fl -list-themes
List theme ids and names (bundled, then the Themes folder's), then exit.
.It Fl -list-flavors
List flavor ids and names, then exit.
.It Fl -frontmatter Ar MODE
How to show frontmatter: table puts it before the body (YAML as a table, TOML as code).
.Pp
.It Fl -wiki-links
Turn [[wiki links]] on or off. Beats the document's mdv.wikilinks (default: off).
.It Fl -no-wiki-links
Turn [[wiki links]] on or off. Beats the document's mdv.wikilinks (default: off).
.It Fl -source-lines
Add data-source-line attributes (the line each block starts on).
.It Fl -no-highlight
Don't syntax-highlight fenced code blocks.
.It Fl -no-heading-anchors
Don't give headings ids and anchor links.
.It Fl -block-remote-images
Replace remote images with a placeholder (default: keep them, as GitHub does).
.It Fl -verbose
Report the flavor and wiki link setting each input used, on standard error.
.It Fl -preprocessor Ar PATH
Run the program at PATH (a file, not a command name) on each input first: the document on its stdin, Markdown on its stdout.
.It Fl -preprocessor-arg Ar ARG...
An argument for the --preprocessor program, passed as is (repeatable).
